    "body": "This Draft PR provides one frozen test-only CI venue for the already-reviewed control-reserve capacity regression. Its base is ci/frontend-parity-capacity-base-c714-20261115 at 22078dc88a1118b2134388743ec41dd72fd73563; its head is the published venue R1 descendant of test stage 328c9446be2bb0c55c273449cd19a569c3bfef9c. Production and workflows remain at the old capacity behavior. The exact source delta is the two reviewed test files plus reviewed documentation/evidence.\n\nThe local full Host transport file produced the specific missing-guard RED. The local full Main invocation was killed before test results and remains unqualified. This PR asks the unchanged original Host Process CI to run its complete eight-file Main command. All other automatically applicable original CI is allowed to run normally, including existing OpenCode/localhost fixtures; real Claude/Codex remain forbidden.\n\nThis is an evidence-only auxiliary Draft PR. Do not merge, mark Ready, request reviews, change labels/base/head, enable auto-merge or cancel useful runs. PR1192 remains the delivery PR with its original base, Draft state and all required resulting-source gates. Main RED, subsequent production changes and GREEN evidence are reviewed separately. No result is claimed in advance.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->\n\n<!-- coderabbit-ai-generated:v1 -->\n\n## Summary by CodeRabbit\n\n* **Documentation**\n  * Added validation records documenting test outcomes, known limitations, and the criteria for further verification.\n* **Tests**\n  * Expanded coverage for configurations with insufficient reserved capacity for control messages, including rejection cases and a valid configuration that can process work and control requests.\n\n<!-- end of auto-generated comment: release notes by coderabbit.ai -->",
